        "subject": "LU-19916 idl: reserve OBD_CONNECT2_MGS_TYPE flag",
        "message": "LU-19916 idl: reserve OBD_CONNECT2_MGS_TYPE flag\n\nReserve OBD_CONNECT2_MGS_TYPE at 0x40000000000000ULL for an MGC that\ntreats mgs_nidtbl_entry::mne_type as a mask, so the MGS can mark a\ntarget whose node also runs an MGS follower.  Only the flag,\nobd_connect_names[] and the wire checks are added here so the value\ncan land before the feature patch.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I8238129eec65d8755a764902ca2300daa4ac47e6\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/69529\nReviewed-by: Sebastien Buisson <sbuisson@ddn.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Keguang Xu <kxu@ddn.com>\n"
